    "Summarize a transcript. Apple Intelligence summarizes on this device, using Apple's Private Cloud Compute if the transcript is long." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fasst ein Transkript zusammen. Apple Intelligence erstellt die Zusammenfassung auf diesem Gerät — bei einem langen Transkript über Apples Private Cloud Compute."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resume una transcripción. Apple Intelligence resume en este dispositivo, usando Private Cloud Compute de Apple si la transcripción es larga."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Résume une transcription. Apple Intelligence résume sur cet appareil, via Private Cloud Compute d'Apple si la transcription est longue."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riassumi una trascrizione. Apple Intelligence genera il riassunto su questo dispositivo, usando Private Cloud Compute di Apple se la trascrizione è lunga."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字起こしを要約します。Apple Intelligenceがこのデバイス上で要約を生成し、長い文字起こしではAppleのPrivate Cloud Computeを使用します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "스크립트를 요약합니다. Apple Intelligence가 이 기기에서 요약을 생성하며, 스크립트가 길면 Apple의 Private Cloud Compute를 사용합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resumir uma transcrição. A Apple Intelligence gera o resumo neste dispositivo, usando o Private Cloud Compute da Apple se a transcrição for longa."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Создать сводку расшифровки. Apple Intelligence формирует сводку на этом устройстве, а для длинной расшифровки использует Apple Private Cloud Compute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概括转录文本内容。Apple Intelligence 会在本机生成摘要，转录文本较长时会使用 Apple 的私有云计算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
